WEBVTT

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.440
Asuka Tennoji                             The Proud  Fierte

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.430
What?

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.260
Oops! Wrong entrance!

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:16.230
Miss Gambiel, I wish 
you'd tone it down a bit.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:20.450
Oh? You're a Cait Sith and 
you're telling me what to do?

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:22.200
I'll kill you.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:24.710
Th-That wasn't my intent!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.530
Well, I wouldn't actually want you dead.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.710
Hey, who are you guys?

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.690
You're Asuka Tennoji, right?

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.220
Good to see you guys aren't dead.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.610
I'm Gambiel, an Aquarius and 
one of the Twelve Apostles.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:41.410
Twelve Apostles, Aquarius  Gambiel

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:41.840
An angel!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:44.730
Cait Sith  Coon

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.990
And this is Coon, a Cait Sith.

00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:44.730
Hi!

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.520
An angel? From the White World?

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.410
Yup!

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:55.030
We came here under orders to look for you,

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:59.580
Fierte the Proud.

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:37.320
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Asuka's Room

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:40.300
Seiryuu Academy High School Dorms - Asuka's Room
December 26th 02:56

00:02:40.830 --> 00:02:42.680
This is great, Fierte!

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.050
She's come to get you!

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:47.060
I don't want to go back.

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:49.700
I'm sure you don't.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.210
Don't worry.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:53.460
I'm not taking you back.

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:55.440
We just needed to know where you were.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.190
What does that—

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:00.230
Anyway, job's done. Time to go home.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:00.940
Okay!

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.220
Hold it!

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:04.200
I've got a lot of questions about this,

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:08.550
but first, fix this wall!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.880
Well, I was going to do it 
whether you told me to or not.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.020
I took down the barrier.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.200
The barrier?

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:36.440
If you put up a barrier before 
you attack, and undo it after,

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.730
anything that broke 
will go back to how it was.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:42.380
We've used that to hide 
all sorts of things.

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:45.310
Appearances are very important to angels.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:50.530
Well, I'm sure that concept 
is beyond mere humans.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:51.930
Mere humans?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:55.750
I'd say there's something more wrong about 
an angel who destroys people's walls.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.120
How rude!

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.440
How dare you, human?!

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.880
Stop it.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.750
If Michael's men find us 
here, we'll have trouble.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:03.960
That's right.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.760
They were looking for the angel killer.

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.760
Angel killer?

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.390
Anyway, time to go.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:11.270
H-Hey!

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:21.280
December 26th 03:04 Kitano, Kobe

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:25.680
Black Blade  Sieger

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:29.790
Ayase Kamiyugi

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:28.170
I'm going to bed, too.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:29.790
Goodnight.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:35.540
You look pretty good fresh out of the bath.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.720
Stop staring at me.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:46.360
Going to bed so tense will just tire you out.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.800
You need to relax a bit.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.790
I won't.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:55.060
I'll fight no matter how I'm dressed, 
no matter what the timing.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:06.440
I can't stand this kind of thing.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.610
I wasn't going to ask, but I have to.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:14.800
What happened, Fierte?

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:21.840
I fled here from my original world.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.090
In my world,

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:31.850
those with strong psyches become 
angels, and are highly respected.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:35.010
But those with less powerful psyches,

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:38.360
humans, are treated like garbage.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.890
This is wrong!

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:45.030
Angels are supposed to lead humanity!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.230
For us to look down on them 
and control them because

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.610
they're less powerful than us...

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:53.020
These measures are necessary 
because of their weak minds.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:58.620
And leading and controlling 
are the same thing, are they not?

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:02.270
But we should be able to co-exist

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.880
equally with humans, like Uriel says.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.130
Four Archangels  Gabriel

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:08.130
What is the point of coexisting?

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.200
With Uriel gone,

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.700
it is my task to protect 
the balance of the world.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:18.140
Your input is not needed.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.710
Gabriel, one of the Four Archangels,

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.100
refused to listen to what I had to say.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:28.350
I fled here in anger.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:34.160
I don't want to go back now.

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:35.970
I see.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.910
Thanks, I guess.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:43.170
Seems you're just like I thought you were.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.920
What does that mean?

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:53.930
<i>Papa! Mama! Wake up!</i>

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.090
<i>Papa! Mama!</i>

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:58.580
<i>No! No!</i>

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.160
<i>Don't die!</i>

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.440
<i>Mama! Mama!</i>

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:05.190
<i>No!</i>

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.950
I'm hungry.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.590
Where's breakfast? I want meat. Meat!

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.130
Here. Breakfast.

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.070
This is cat food.

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.370
You're so spoiled.

00:07:46.420 --> 00:07:47.710
Pendragon Apostle's Church, Kobe City

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:51.650
Pendragon Apostle's Church, Kobe City
December 26th 03:30

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:57.950
Angels who lead us.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:01.230
Give us power.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:04.460
Give us power.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.460
You understand, right?

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:09.460
If they find out about Fierte, 
it will cause problems.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.180
I know!

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:13.280
Leave it to me!

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.510
I'll keep a close eye out.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:19.600
Michael's forces are already on the move.

00:08:19.900 --> 00:08:22.960
Make sure he doesn't find out.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:23.980
Yes, sir!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.980
December 26th 13:28 Kobe Port

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.630
<i>Hey, how long are you 
gonna keep doing this?</i>

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.000
Doing what?

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.240
<i>Killing angels.</i>

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.110
<i>You're not seriously going to kill</i>

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:44.460
<i>every angel in the White World, are you?</i>

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.710
If I need to.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:51.700
<i>Well, I'm happy as long as 
I get to do lots of killing.</i>

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:56.450
<i>But is a life spent on 
nothing but revenge fun?</i>

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.010
It doesn't matter whether it's fun.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:01.560
It's something I need to do.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.500
Need to, huh?

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:12.840
Sold Out

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:12.190
I'm sorry, I don't know 
when we'll get more.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.820
I see.

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:17.800
<b>Dish Soap</b>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.320
<b>Today Only</b>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.320
<b>Limited Time Only</b>

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.320
<b>Closeout Sale</b>

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.410
<b>Pharmacy</b>

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:27.870
U-Um, go ahead.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:30.280
No, you were first.

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.930
Oh, here it is!

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.110
I'm so glad I found some!

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:37.990
Aina Mikage

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.680
Are you looking for dish soap?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:42.430
Yes, but I don't know this area well.

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:44.770
Then I'll help you find some.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.430
I'm Aina.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.760
Aina Mikage.

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:50.810
Ayase Kamiyugi.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:53.350
Nice to meet you, Kamiyugi.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.530
I'll show you around.

00:09:57.020 --> 00:10:00.510
There's another drug store up ahead.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:03.470
It's a bit further from the station, so...

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:13.300
December 26th 14:15 Cafe Broccolo

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.800
<i>That angel from yesterday...</i>

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:19.050
<i>They were looking for the angel killer.</i>

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:22.050
<i>Could the angel killer be...</i>

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:29.660
December 26th 14:18 Kobe City

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:53.020
December 26th 15:19 Kobe - Fountain Park

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:53.790
So you've just come to Kobe, huh?

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:54.940
Yes.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.050
What brought you here?

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:59.330
Did you evacuate here?

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:02.350
No, not really.

00:11:02.350 --> 00:11:08.660
I'm sorry. I moved here a year ago 
myself, after losing my family.

00:11:08.660 --> 00:11:09.680
I see.

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.120
It seems like there are 
a lot of people like that

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:15.660
since the Black Points appeared.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.030
There are a few at my school, too.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.220
School?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:24.470
You don't go to school?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.920
No. I used to, but...

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:32.570
I don't know if I'm going to be here long.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.420
I see.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.920
School's fun, though.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.600
There are some really good-looking boys.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.980
Your face is red.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:49.130
Huh? Oh, I was just... 
r-remembering something.

00:11:49.130 --> 00:11:50.270
Your boyfriend?

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:51.470
No, not yet!

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:55.030
I mean... no, it's not like that.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.590
He's so cool and so nice.

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:01.110
And sometimes kind of 
helpless, which is cute.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:04.620
You like him.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:06.430
Yeah.

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:10.120
Do you have a person you like?

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:14.880
No.

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.630
I don't need one.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.760
December 15:22 Kobe - Chinatown

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:34.020
Seems like they should be here soon.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.270
This might make for a good show.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.520
Yup!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:43.350
What's the name of the girl 
we're supposed to kill?

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:45.150
Um, it was...

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.300
Ayase Kamiyugi.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.790
She's got a Black World Z/X 
named Sieger with her.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.000
A Black World Z/X, huh?

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.870
This'll be fun.

00:12:56.600 --> 00:13:01.020
December 26th 16:28 Kobe City

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.220
Thanks for everything.

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:01.100
No, thank you.

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.370
I'm happy I met you, Kamiyugi.

00:13:05.140 --> 00:13:06.300
Ayase...

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.250
Would you call me Ayase?

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:17.060
It's been a long time since 
I last spoke with a girl my age.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.320
Things aren't easy for either 
of us, but let's do our best.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.630
If there's anything I can 
help you with, tell me.

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:33.310
Okay. Thanks.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:35.850
And you can call me Aina, too!

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:36.870
Ayase!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:44.970
What?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:05.740
December 26th 16:30 Cafe Broccolo

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.110
I'm sorry.

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:06.900
Wh-What's going on?

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.810
<i>A barrier.</i>

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:12.440
<i>The angels have appeared.</i>

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:14.410
Why isn't anyone moving?

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:18.920
<i>Only those with resources 
can move inside a barrier.</i>

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.830
<i>But this barrier is a big one.</i>

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.800
<i>There must be a lot of angels.</i>

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.050
<i>Wait!</i>

00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:41.350
Activate!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.830
Why are they all wearing 
those stupid helmets?

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:56.250
How rude!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.080
I won't be insulted by a 
lesser life form like you.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.330
Kill them.

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:03.080
This'll be fun!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:07.880
<i>Asuka Tennoji, what are you doing?</i>

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:11.450
They might be after Ayase.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:12.590
<i>Ayase?</i>

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.110
<i>What do you intend to do?</i>

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:19.100
If they're after Ayase, I'm going to save her.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:23.360
<i>Save her? Why do we have to save her?</i>

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:27.860
I don't have a reason.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:30.960
I just want to save her!

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.870
Oh, they're going at it.

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.480
<i>It looks like the barrier is gone.</i>

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.190
What do we do?

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:27.250
Sword Sniper  Rigel       Azumi Kagamihara

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:26.600
Let's watch.

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:30.630
Ayase! Resources! I need more power!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:32.430
I'm doing it now.

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.300
A power outage?

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.550
Ayase?

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:06.370
Where are you?

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:10.380
Aina!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:13.380
Tennoji!

00:17:13.910 --> 00:17:17.440
Aina... Sorry, I'm in a hurry...

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:21.640
Ayase...

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.140
Tennoji?

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:34.740
<i>I don't have a reason.</i>

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.320
<i>I just want to save her.</i>

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:39.990
<i>She's trying to kill him.</i>

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:40.990
<i>Why?</i>

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:46.410
This is boring. It's so 
obvious who's going to win.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:48.000
You're right.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.840
Not that it matters to me.

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:05.890
Ayase!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:22.100
December 26th 18:11 Rokkou Mountain

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:33.230
Ayase!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.840
Activate!

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:52.980
How dare a mere human slay an angel?

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.360
Why are you—

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:02.910
I guess I'm just a hero of justice.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:03.970
Asuka!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:11.830
You hurt an innocent human, 
and you call yourselves angels?

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.600
You...

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:15.880
You can't be...

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.250
Withdraw!

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:28.270
The angels are leaving.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:33.030
That Fierte is no ordinary angel.

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:41.130
Why did you do something so reckless?

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:43.650
I didn't really think about it.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:48.240
Whoa... I guess you can
heal people too, huh?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.480
Thanks.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:53.380
Don't do that again, okay?

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.020
Oh, you guys are here, too?

00:19:57.020 --> 00:19:57.860
Yeah.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:00.510
We just came to see what 
the fuss was about.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.430
The power's back on.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.770
Well? Pretty, isn't it?

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:13.110
I hope the lights of this town never go out.

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.780
As long as the lights are on,

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:20.420
that means everyone is living their lives.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:23.350
We take it for granted, but it's important.

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:27.700
You're not going to try and protect 
the town yourself, are you?

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:31.130
I couldn't do something that big.

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:34.070
But I'll do whatever I can.

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:39.300
Well, it's cold, so let's head back.

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.390
I'll repay you for saving me.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.060
I won't attack the angel with you.

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:56.810
Thanks, Ayase.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:00.280
I'm not doing it for you.

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.940
And don't call me by my first name.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.570
Why not? We're friends now, right?

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.570
I haven't agreed to that!

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:13.400
Asuka, Ayase, Azumi...

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:16.490
After a strange fate brought them together,

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.120
the trio looked down on the lights of Kobe.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.720
Thinking back,

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:24.300
this may have been when their 
hearts truly met for the first time.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:28.620
But none of them knew then 
that something would happen

00:21:29.030 --> 00:21:32.600
that would shake the lights of this city.

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:39.590
I can't believe we saw someone 
that important out here.

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:42.200
We'll need to tell Michael.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.990
I'm afraid that's not happening.

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:50.890
Sorry, I'm not doing this for fun.

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:56.040
It's Gabriel's orders.

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:08.710
We can't let this news get out yet.

00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:43.740
Next time on <i>Z/X Ignition</i>:

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:54.980
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:46.360
Phase 5.

00:23:47.790 --> 00:23:51.490
What color is the future that 
will be drawn to Aina Mikage?
